comment5.text=\r\n\ Procura\ a\ a\u00E7\u00E3o\ ligada\ a\ uma\ tecla.\r\n\ Devolve\ null\ se\ a\ tecla\ n\u00E3o\ corresponder\ a\ nenhuma\ a\u00E7\u00E3o.\r\n
